   "usage_notes": "The locative plural form ręku (historically a locative dual form) may be used for a single hand/arm or the hands/arms of a single person, and is used chiefly directly after w and na, and it is proscribed to use any sort of adjective etc. between the preposition and the noun. This form may be considered slightly more higher register."
